### STS Operation API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/sts-operations
@motherVesselId = MOTHER_VESSEL_TRACKING_ID_HERE
@receivingVesselId = RECEIVING_VESSEL_TRACKING_ID_HERE
@supervisingVesselId = SUPERVISING_VESSEL_TRACKING_ID_HERE
@trackingId = RECORD_TRACKING_ID_HERE

### 1. Create new STS operation
POST {{baseUrl}}/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operationNumber": "STS-2024-001",
  "motherVesselTrackingId": "{{motherVesselId}}",
  "receivingVesselTrackingId": "{{receivingVesselId}}",
  "supervisingVesselTrackingId": "{{supervisingVesselId}}",
  "startDate": "2024-11-20T06:00:00",
  "endDate": "2024-11-20T18:00:00",
  "status": "PLANIFIEE",
  "cargoType": "CRUDE_OIL",
  "quantityTransferred": 50000.0,
  "unit": "BARRELS",
  "maritimeZone": "ANCHORAGE_ZONE",
  "coordinates": "6.2° N, 1.5° E",
  "weatherConditions": "Favorable",
  "pollutionOccurred": false,
  "remarks": "Standard STS transfer operation"
}

### 2. Update STS operation (Path Variable)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/update/{{trackingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operationNumber": "STS-2024-001",
  "motherVesselTrackingId": "{{motherVesselId}}",
  "receivingVesselTrackingId": "{{receivingVesselId}}",
  "supervisingVesselTrackingId": "{{supervisingVesselId}}",
  "startDate": "2024-11-20T06:00:00",
  "endDate": "2024-11-20T17:30:00",
  "status": "TERMINEE",
  "cargoType": "CRUDE_OIL",
  "quantityTransferred": 48500.0,
  "unit": "BARRELS",
  "maritimeZone": "ANCHORAGE_ZONE",
  "coordinates": "6.2° N, 1.5° E",
  "weatherConditions": "Favorable",
  "pollutionOccurred": false,
  "remarks": "Operation completed successfully ahead of schedule"
}

### 3. Get specific STS operation (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/get/{{trackingId}}

### 4. Get by operation number (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/get/operation-number/STS-2024-001

### 5. Get by mother vessel (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/mother-vessel/{{motherVesselId}}

### 6. Get by receiving vessel (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/receiving-vessel/{{receivingVesselId}}

### 7. Get by supervising vessel (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/supervising-vessel/{{supervisingVesselId}}

### 8. Get ongoing operations
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/ongoing

### 9. Get by status (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/status/PLANIFIEE

### 10. Get operations by period (Path Variables - NEW FORMAT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/period/2024-01-01T00:00:00/2024-12-31T23:59:59

### 11. Get by cargo type (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/cargo-type/CRUDE_OIL

### 12. Get operations with pollution
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/with-pollution

### 13. Get by maritime zone (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/maritime-zone/ANCHORAGE_ZONE

### 14. Get all STS operations
GET {{baseUrl}}/list

### 15. Delete STS operation (Path Variable)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/delete/{{trackingId}}
